---
import SegmentedControl from './SegmentedControl.astro';
---
<div class="calculator" data-calculator data-kind="cooling">
<form class="card calc-form" novalidate>
  <p class="form-kicker">DATOS DE PARTIDA</p><h2>Datos de la estancia</h2>
  <div class="fields">
    <div><label for="area">Superficie</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="area" name="area" value="30" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="area-error"/><span>m²</span></div><span class="error" id="area-error"></span></div>
    <div><label for="height">Altura</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="height" name="height" value="2,5" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="height-error"/><span>m</span></div><span class="error" id="height-error"></span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-section"><p class="form-section-title"><span>01</span>Condiciones térmicas</p>
    <SegmentedControl name="climate" legend="Zona climática orientativa" selected="warm" options={[['mild','Suave'],['warm','Cálida'],['hot','Muy cálida']]}/>
    <div class="mt-5"><SegmentedControl name="orientation" legend="Orientación principal" selected="S" columns={4} options={[['N','Norte'],['E','Este'],['S','Sur'],['O','Oeste']]}/></div>
    <div class="mt-5"><SegmentedControl name="insulation" legend="Aislamiento" selected="average" options={[['good','Bueno'],['average','Medio'],['poor','Deficiente']]}/></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-section"><p class="form-section-title"><span>02</span>Cargas adicionales</p><div class="fields">
    <div><label for="glass">Superficie acristalada</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="glass" name="glass" value="5" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="glass-error"/><span>m²</span></div><span class="error" id="glass-error"></span></div>
    <div><label for="people">Personas habituales</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="people" name="people" value="2" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="people-error"/><span>personas</span></div><span class="error" id="people-error"></span></div>
    <div><label for="internalW">Cargas internas relevantes</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="internalW" name="internalW" value="200" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="internalW-error"/><span>W</span></div><span class="error" id="internalW-error"></span></div>
  </div></div>
  <p class="help">La zona no es una zona climática oficial del CTE: selecciona un escenario orientativo. Las cargas internas deben ser las que quieras sumar.</p>
  <div class="actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Calcular potencia</button><button class="button secondary" type="reset">Restablecer</button></div>
</form>
<section class="card result result-kind-cooling"><p class="eyebrow">TU ESTIMACIÓN</p><h2>Potencia de refrigeración</h2><div id="result-output" aria-live="polite"><p>Revisa los datos y pulsa «Calcular potencia».</p></div></section>
</div>
<script>import '../lib/calculator-ui.mjs';</script>